This product will download third-party engines and models on demand at
the user's request (llama.cpp, MLX-based servers, ComfyUI, speech
runtimes, and the models the user selects). None of them are vendored
here. Each is fetched from its pinned upstream URL, checksum verified,
and used under its own licence, which the Stack records with the
download and shows before selection. Attributions for anything this
repo redistributes are listed here as they are added.
